      "text": "Parkinson\u2019s research participation spans observational biomarker cohorts, online studies, trial matching tools and genetic research. PPMI combines longitudinal biomarker research with online, mailed-screening and in-person participation routes. Fox Trial Finder connects volunteers with recruiting studies, while Fox Insight collects self-reported health experiences online. PDBP and the AMP Parkinson\u2019s Disease platform support sharing of research data, and PD GENEration offers genetic testing and counseling. Participation opportunities coexist with incomplete demographic reporting and practical barriers documented in specific research populations. Foundation listings do not constitute endorsement of participation.",
